# Always push the PWA

After any change under the web PWA (`src/`, Worker config, `wrangler`, deploy workflow, public assets, etc.):

1. **Commit** the relevant web files (do not wait to be asked).
2. **Push to `origin/main`** so GitHub Actions deploys and the user can check live immediately.
3. Mention the live URL briefly when done (Workers / fordays.app as configured).

Do **not** block on iOS/Swift work before shipping web. Push PWA changes as soon as they are ready, even mid-session.

Native `ios/` changes do not need this auto-push unless the user asks.
